# TypeScript

Canonical source: `docs/standards/typescript-standard.md`.

Repository defaults: strict typing, named exports, functional components,
descriptive names, `type` over `interface` except for third-party extension,
string unions over enums unless GraphQL requires an enum, and no `any`.

Use shared guards and helpers before writing local equivalents. Validate with
the package Nx `typecheck` target.
